/* Every external symbol of Mbed TLS 3.6.7 as this library configures it (aqua_mbedtls_config.h includes this file, so
 * all Mbed TLS sources and the library's own code see it), renamed with the prefix aqua_network_: another library or
 * application linking its own Mbed TLS cannot clash with this copy. The list is the defined external symbols of the
 * built library on every target (llvm-nm --defined-only --extern-only); refresh it when Mbed TLS or the
 * configuration changes. Names that are macros on some targets stay inside their target's branch. */
